        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBEL19ENTR, Keyed Entry Bellagio Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Single Cylinder Keyed Entry Bellagio Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate has a timeless beauty. The curved beauty of the Bellagio Lever paired with the rectangular Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is a classic. This Bellagio Keyed Entry Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. It comes packaged as a complete set for one door (both sides). It will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. A single cylinder lock, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turnknob on the interior while the levers operate the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/bellagio-paddle-lever-with-fifth-avenue-plate-grandeur-favbel19\"><b>Bellagio Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Grandeur Bellagio Lever with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Bellagio Leverset with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVBEL19ENT-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262394\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVBEL19ENT Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
